# GPU-014 (tests/headless graphics-report-desktop-down): reads devmgr's
# renderer report through its graphics-observer endpoint (startup plan
# only), once a second, and says each entry, until Desktop's output entry
# is there and stale (Desktop has exited) or a minute has passed.
(Executable_Manifest
  identity => "com.cubit.test.graphics-report-check"
  version => "0.1.0"
  requests => [(service "logstore" "logstore") (service "graphics-observer" "graphics-observer")])
